Note on bundled data
====================

The MIT license above covers the source code, stylesheets and documentation of
this project (`src/`, `scripts/`, `tests/`, `docs/`, `README.md`).

The real-world sample data under `public/data/` (`000970.pcd`, `000970.json`,
`calib_front.json`, `front_000970.jpg`) is copied from SUSTechPOINTS
(https://github.com/sustech-isus/SUSTechPOINTS), which is licensed under
GPL-3.0. Those files remain under GPL-3.0 and are included here for study and
demonstration only. Remove them if you need a purely MIT-licensed copy.

Aggregated data produced by `scripts/convert_nuscenes.py` derives from the
nuScenes dataset (https://www.nuscenes.org/), which is distributed under
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 and is not part of this repository's license.
